, "<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">38</span></span></p>\r\n"], "options_hi": ["<p><span><span style=\"font-family:Cambria,serif\"><span style=\"font-size:19px\">72</span></span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">78</span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">39</span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">38</span></span></p>\r\n"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "", "solution_hi": "", "marks": 2, "neg": 0.6666666666666666, "chap": "Calculation"}, {"q_en": "<p>65&nbsp;&times; 65</p>\r\n", "q_hi": "<p>65&nbsp;&times; 65</p>\r\n", "options_en": ["<p>4125</p>\r\n", "<p>3625</p>\r\n", "<p>4225</p>\r\n", "<p>1325</p>\r\n"], "options_hi": ["<p>4125</p>\r\n", "<p>3625</p>\r\n", "<p>4225</p>\r\n", "<p>1325</p>\r\n"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>The correct answer is&nbsp;<strong>option 3&nbsp;</strong>i.e.&nbsp;<strong>4225</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>65&nbsp;&times; 65</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For these type of questions where we have to multiply a two digit number ending with 5 with itself only, we can use this one trick:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Let the number is n5. Then, for n5&nbsp;&times; n5</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Last two digits:&nbsp;</strong>25</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>First (one or two) digits:</strong> Product of n and (n + 1)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>65&nbsp;&times; 65 = [6 &times;&nbsp;7]25 = 4225</p>\r\n", "solution_hi": "<p>सही उत्तर<strong> विकल्प 3</strong> यानी<strong> 4225</strong> है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>65 &times; 65</p>\r\n\r\n<p>इस प्रकार के प्रश्नों के लिए जहाँ हमें 5 पर समाप्त होने वाली दो अंकों की संख्या को स्वयं से गुणा करना है, हम इस एक तरकीब का उपयोग कर सकते हैं:</p>\r\n\r\n<p>मान लें कि संख्या n5 है। फिर, n5 &times; n5 के लिए</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>अंतिम दो अंक: </strong>25</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>पहले (एक या दो) अंक:</strong> n और (n + 1) का गुणनफल</p>\r\n\r\n<p>तो,</p>\r\n\r\n<p>65&nbsp;&times; 65 = [6 &times;&nbsp;7]25 = 4225</p>\r\n", "marks": 2, "neg": 0.6666666666666666, "chap": "Calculation"}, {"q_en": "<p>93&nbsp;&times; 75&nbsp;&times; 89</p>\r\n", "q_hi": "<p>93&nbsp;&times; 75&nbsp;&times; 89</p>\r\n", "options_en": ["<p>620775</p>\r\n", "<p>620785</p>\r\n", "<p>620875</p>\r\n", "<p>630775</p>\r\n"], "options_hi": ["<p>620775</p>\r\n", "<p>620785</p>\r\n", "<p>620875</p>\r\n", "<p>630775</p>\r\n"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>The correct answer is <strong>option 1</strong> i.e. <strong>620775</strong>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>93&nbsp;&times; 75&nbsp;&times; 89</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hranker.com/admin/assets/uploads/ckeditor/double digitsd2025_05_28_18_10_39.png\" style=\"height:94px; width:300px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8277&nbsp;&times; 75</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8277&nbsp;&times; (100 - 25)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 827700 - 206925</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 620775</p>\r\n", "solution_hi": "<!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">-->\r\n<p>सही उत्तर <strong>विकल्प 1</strong> अर्थात <strong>620775&nbsp;</strong>है।&nbsp;<!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--></p>\r\n\r\n<p>93&nbsp;&times; 75&nbsp;&times; 89</p>\r\n\r\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hranker.com/admin/assets/uploads/ckeditor/double digitsd2025_05_28_18_10_39.png\" style=\"height:94px; width:300px\" /></p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8277&nbsp;&times; 75</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 8277&nbsp;&times; (100 - 25)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 827700 - 206925</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 620775</p>\r\n", "marks": 2, "neg": 0.6666666666666666, "chap": "Calculation"}, {"q_en": "<p>3 - 9 - 5 - 4</p>\r\n", "q_hi": "<p>3 - 9 - 5 - 4</p>\r\n", "options_en": ["<p>-12</p>\r\n", "<p>15</p>\r\n", "<p>-15</p>\r\n", "<p>12</p>\r\n"], "options_hi": ["<p>-12</p>\r\n", "<p>15</p>\r\n", "<p>-15</p>\r\n", "<p>12</p>\r\n"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>The correct answer is <strong>option 3</strong> i.e. <strong>-15.</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>If a larger number is subtracted from a smaller number, the result is negative. So, we just have to subtract the smaller number from the larger number and then put a negative &#39;-&#39; sign before the resultant number.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3 - 9 - 5 - 4</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 3 - 9 - (5 + 4)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 3 - 9 - 9</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 3 - (9 + 9)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 3 - 18</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= -(18 - 3)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= -15</p>\r\n\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n", "solution_hi": "<!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--><!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">-->\r\n<p>सही उत्तर <strong>विकल्प 3</strong> अर्थात <strong>-15&nbsp;</strong>है।&nbsp;<!--<div contenteditable=\"true\" style=\"position: relative;\">--></p>\r\n\r\n<p>यदि किसी बड़ी संख्या को किसी छोटी संख्या से घटाया जाए, तो परिणाम ऋणात्मक होता है। इसलिए, हमें बस बड़ी संख्या से छोटी संख्या को घटाना है और फिर परिणामी संख्या के आगे ऋणात्मक &#39;-&#39; चिह्न लगाना है।</p>\r\n\r\n<p>3 - 9 - 5 - 4</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 3 - 9 - (5 + 4)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 3 - 9 - 9</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 3 - (9 + 9)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= 3 - 18</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= -(18 - 3)</p>\r\n\r\n<p>= -15</p>\r\n", "marks": 2, "neg": 0.6666666666666666, "chap": "Calculation"}, {"q_en": "<p><img src=\"https://www.thepunditsofficial.in/admin/uploads/questions/q_6996cfb6749885.91850988.png\" style=\"height:49px; width:297px\" /></p>\r\n", "q_hi": "<p><img src=\"https://www.thepunditsofficial.in/admin/uploads/questions/q_6996cfb6749885.91850988.png\" style=\"height:49px; width:297px\" /></p>\r\n", "options_en": ["<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">27.765</span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">27.775</span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">27.75</span></span></p>\r\n", "<p><span><span style=\"font-size:19px\">27.025</span></span></p>\r\n"], "options_hi": ["<p><sp